<title>USA: Royal Caribbean to redeem $104.5 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Royal Caribbean to redeem $104.5 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd said Friday that it is redeeming the remaining $104.5 million of its 11.375 per cent senior subordinated notes due 2002, on May 15.</p>
<p>The redemption price is 104.950 per cent of the principal amount, together with accrued and unpaid interest through May 15.</p>
